//Texts for EventScript_LevelPartyToCap (assembly/overworld_scripts/level_cap.s).
//[BUFFER1] = the Pokemon, [BUFFER2] = the move or the level, [BUFFER3] = the forgotten move.

#org @gText_LevelUpToCap_Learned
[BLACK][GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK] ha imparato\n[GREEN][BUFFER2][BLACK]!

#org @gText_LevelUpToCap_WantsToLearn
[BLACK][GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK] vuole imparare\n[GREEN][BUFFER2][BLACK].\pMa conosce gi[16] quattro mosse.\nVuoi che ne dimentichi una?

#org @gText_LevelUpToCap_DidNotLearn
[BLACK][GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK] non ha imparato\n[GREEN][BUFFER2][BLACK].

#org @gText_LevelUpToCap_ForgotAndLearned
[BLACK]1, 2 e... Puff!\p[GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK] ha dimenticato\n[GREEN][BUFFER3][BLACK].\pE...\p[GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK] ha imparato\n[GREEN][BUFFER2][BLACK]!

#org @gText_LevelUpToCap_GrewToLevel
[BLACK][GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK] [1A] salito al Lv. [BUFFER2]!

#org @gText_LevelUpToCap_AlreadyAtCap
[BLACK]I tuoi Pok\emon hanno gi[16] raggiunto\nil livello massimo per ora!
